        "image_link_2": "",
        "hide_image_2": false,
        "heading": "Our story",
        "description": "<p>I started LAY LO in 2019 with one simple goal: to create products for my dogs that I’d be proud to showcase in my home.<br/><br/>What began as a personal mission has grown into something so much bigger, thanks to an incredible team and our shared passion for elevating life with dogs.</p><p>Over the past five years, we’ve designed more than fifteen unique bed collections, partnered with amazing retailers like Bloomingdale’s, and collaborated with visionaries like Etsy, Joseph Altuzarra, and John Legend.</p><p>In 2023, we expanded our mission with the launch of the LAY LO Collective and Homeschool by LAY LO, bringing expert guidance together with our thoughtfully designed products. Whether it’s 1:1 live help from certified training experts or simple tips to make life with your dog easier, everything we do is aimed at helping you and your dog feel closer at home.</p><p>Thank you for being part of this journey.</p><p>— Gabriela, Founder</p>",
        "button_text": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "btn--primary btn--small",
        "video_text": "",
        "video_link": "",
